Figure 6.25: The correlation between the peak of Long-MRPC two-end TDC difference distribution and the beam position from the MWPC for the USTC module. The left panel is for incident angle of \(0^{\circ}\) and the right panel for \(32.8^{\circ}\). The straight line is a linear fit to the data.

